nd doing it in a fun  way we're having an impact actually I  should say those organizations are  having an impact in school choice week  is really just the template that they or  the you know blank piece of paper that  they write on and of course the power of  real marketing using real marketing  techniques and applying those marketing  techniques to smart public policy cannot  be understated and those are the  takeaways that I think that we've  learned from school choice week over the  last five years that will continue to  use to guide us in the future and you  know I do think that if we remember  these things and if we remember what I  try to tell people that we in the school  choice movement must never forget that  were really only as good as the stories  we tell and those stories are of the  parents were choosing great schools  regardless of the kind for their kids  their kids are succeeding and  communities are getting better as a  result and it's been an honor to help  tell those stories and I hope to  continue to be able to do that and work  with all of you in telling the stories  of these parents who are in my opinion  heroes so thank you all so much
 

